# MASTER BUILD PROMPT — EDUSPHERE AI
## AI-Powered School Learning & Teacher Community Platform

**Role:** Act as a senior full-stack engineer, software architect, UI/UX designer and product engineer. Build a polished, responsive, functional web application suitable for a competitive product-building challenge.

**Time constraint:** Approximately 90 minutes.

**Primary objective:** Deliver a visually impressive, working MVP with real backend integration wherever possible. Prioritize a complete end-to-end user experience over a large number of unfinished features.

---

# 1. PRODUCT VISION

Build **EduSphere AI**, an AI-powered educational platform for school students in Classes 1–12.

EduSphere AI combines personalized learning, AI-assisted education, competitive multiplayer quizzes, gamification, student performance analytics and a community where verified teachers voluntarily help students.

It should feel like a real educational technology product, not a generic dashboard template or a collection of disconnected demo pages.

### Core product philosophy

Students should be able to:

- Learn difficult topics with an AI tutor.
- Generate structured study notes.
- Practice AI-generated quizzes.
- Compete with other students in live multiplayer quizzes.
- Ask questions and receive explanations from verified teachers.
- Track their academic performance.
- Earn XP and progress through levels.
- Follow a personalized study plan.

Teachers should be able to:

- Register and submit qualification certificates.
- Receive admin approval.
- Answer student questions.
- Upload educational explanations and resources.
- Create quizzes.
- Host live quiz competitions.
- Publish study materials.

Administrators should be able to:

- Verify teachers.
- Manage users.
- Moderate questions and answers.
- Review reported content.
- Manage educational curriculum data.
- Monitor platform activity.

### Target audience

- School students: Classes 1–12.
- Teachers: School educators and qualified subject experts.
- Administrators: Platform management team.

### Supported curriculum

Support multiple education boards through configurable data:

- CBSE
- SEBA / Assam State Board
- ICSE
- Other boards through an extensible structure.

Do not hardcode the entire platform around one board.

